flowchart TD
    A["a value the ABI put in a register"] --> B["report the value itself"]
    B --> B2["no alloca, nothing escapes,<br/>no frame is realigned:<br/>target-independent"]
    A --> C["spill it to an alloca and<br/>report the slot address"]
    C --> D["the slot escapes, so (K)ASan<br/>adds a redzone and<br/>32-byte alignment"]
    D --> F["the frame is realigned, so the<br/>backend reserves a base pointer"]
    F --> H["on x86-64 that register is RBX"]
    H --> I["a function whose inline asm also<br/>claims RBX then fails to build:<br/>'Interference usage of base<br/>pointer/frame pointer'"]
